 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-077: Exp4330 Either Banks Shallow-Tail Reproduced L1 Solves Or Records Real No-Advances
 **Description:** Running Exp 4330 either writes `blocked_arc_env_unreachable` when offline ARC fixtures or imports are unavailable, writes `success: adapter_free_shallow_tail_<n>_games_advanced_total<levels>` when one or more swept shallow-tail games produce a new offline-reproduced L1 solve, or writes `complete: adapter_free_shallow_tail_no_advance_real_exploration_total13` when every swept game takes real actions but no new reproduced advance lands. The artifact MUST set `reproducible_total_levels>=13`, `verifier_is_oracle=true`, `submitted_to_leaderboard=false`, include the exact swept-game set and exclusions, report `tn36_schema_finding`, compute `reproducibility_checksum` from trajectories plus reproduction-gate results, and require every `per_game_exploration_actions` row to have `exploration_actions_used>0` unless the terminal verdict is `blocked_arc_env_unreachable`.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-078: ARC-AGI-3 E3 Explore-Verify-Plan ar25 Refined World Model Exp4339
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4339 as an offline, no-leaderboard E3 explore-verify-plan refinement attempt on `ar25`, using `results/arc_e3/ar25/world_model.py` as the induced model deliverable. It MUST first confirm that `environment_files/ar25/` is non-empty, that `python/carnot/agentic/arc_executable_world_model.py` and `python/carnot/agentic/arc_solver_kit.py` import, that TRM training is stood down, and that `scripts/research_conductor.py` is not modified; if the ar25 offline simulator is missing it MUST write `honest_verdict="blocked_offline_env_missing_ar25"` and stop without leaderboard submission. The workflow MUST collect offline `collect_transitions("ar25")` data, run an AERA-style explore phase that records verifier-gated transition lemmas before planning, run Agent2World-style adaptive unit probes against hidden-rule mismatch classes, score `WorldModelVerifier` reproduction accuracy per refactor round, and plan only after the model has passed the bounded mechanic checks. A solve SHALL be accepted only when the induced-model plan executes without trusting a divergent prediction and `arc_solver_kit.reproduce()` reports at least one offline-reproduced level. If the bounded round budget ends without such a reproduced solve, it MUST write an honest partial artifact with the best verifier accuracy and residual mismatch class, and it MUST record the residual as a missing-world-model-rule gap for `ar25`. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4339_e3_explore_verify_plan_ar25.json` MUST include `honest_verdict`, `verifier_accuracy_per_round`, `explore_lemmas_collected`, `world_model_path`, `world_model_sha256`, `offline_reproduced`, `reproduced_levels`, `plan_executed`, `verifier_is_oracle`, `preconditions_checked`, `random_seed`, and `reproducibility_checksum`, with `explore_lemmas_collected`, `offline_reproduced`, `reproduced_levels`, `plan_executed`, and `verifier_is_oracle` emitted as bare values rather than principle-wrapped dictionaries. The artifact field principles SHALL be exactly: `honest_verdict` = `Terminal-prefixed (success_e3_ar25_L1_reproduced or complete_e3_ar25_partial_model_<acc>). A reproduced L1 solve and an honest partial (refined model + residual gap) are BOTH progress.`; `verifier_accuracy_per_round` = `list[float]: the verifier is the moat; its reproduction rate per refactor round is the only trustworthy progress signal (compare to .400's single 0.89 round).`; `explore_lemmas_collected` = `BARE int: the count of verifier-gated transition lemmas the EXPLORE phase confirmed before planning -- the AERA explore-before-plan discipline that fixes the .400 plan_executed=false failure.`; `world_model_path` = `results/arc_e3/ar25/world_model.py -- the induced model IS the deliverable.`; `world_model_sha256` = `Hash of the induced world model -- makes the solve auditable/reproducible.`; `offline_reproduced` = `BARE bool: the real env reaches L1 via the induced-model plan, re-gated by arc_solver_kit.reproduce() -- only reproduced levels count.`; `reproduced_levels` = `BARE int: levels offline-reproduced on ar25 (target >=1) -- the +1 incremental-progress unit.`; `plan_executed` = `BARE bool + divergence_step: execution-grounded confirmation; halt-on-divergence prevents trusting a wrong model (the .400 failure was plan_executed=false).`; `verifier_is_oracle` = `BARE bool=true -- the SOLVE is EXECUTION-GROUNDED (the real env defines the win); ARC NORTH-STAR PROGRESS, NOT an oracle-distinct verifier-moat headline.`; `preconditions_checked` = `Records the offline-env presence + harness import + TRM-stand-down; pre-empts the silent-missing-resource fabrication mode.`; `random_seed` = `Determinism precondition for the induction + exploration + planning.`; `reproducibility_checksum` = `Hash of the world model + the plan + the reproduce() result; lets a third party re-run.`
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-078: Exp4339 Either Reproduces ar25 L1 Or Records An Honest Refined-Model Partial
+**Description:** Running Exp 4339 either writes `blocked_offline_env_missing_ar25` when the local ar25 simulator is absent, writes `success_e3_ar25_L1_reproduced` only when the refined induced-model plan is execution-grounded and independently reproduces at least L1 offline, or writes `complete_e3_ar25_partial_model_<acc>` when the bounded explore-verify-plan attempt does not reach the reproduced-L1 gate. A successful run MUST set `offline_reproduced=true`, `reproduced_levels>=1`, `plan_executed=true`, `explore_lemmas_collected>0`, `verifier_is_oracle=true`, preserve the world model path and hash, and compute the reproducibility checksum from the world model hash, plan, reproduction result, verifier rounds, and explore lemma count. A partial run MUST set `offline_reproduced=false`, `reproduced_levels=0`, preserve `verifier_accuracy_per_round` and `explore_lemmas_collected`, preserve the world model path and hash, report the best verifier accuracy and residual mismatch class, and record the residual mismatch as a missing-world-model-rule gap rather than claiming a solve.
